==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Morgrem|124}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion; both cards have the False Surrender attack.
*{{m|False Surrender}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Morgrem}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

